# Only the port's own sources go in the repository. Everything below is
# fetched, built, the user's own data or derived from the game:
#   - the ROM, code.bin, the generated C++ (title-content/) and the title's
#     SPIR-V never live here at all;
#   - PGO profiles (pgo/) are measurements of the game's code;
#   - packages (out/) embed the generated code.
